{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation","id":1283761,"title":"2019 Kickstarter schedule speculation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-01-30T12:06:52-08:00","id":1283761,"title":"2019 Kickstarter schedule speculation","content":"Hi everyone! With the new year almost a month in, and the successful completion of the They Came From Beneath the Sea! Kickstarter, and the announcement of the Lunars Exalted 3rd edition kickstarter, I thought I'd be fun to go through a possible schedule of kickstarters this year and see what everyone's guesses are. As we all know Onyxpath does not give estimated end dates for its books or longterm schedule announcements about exact Kickstarter order as part of a very responsible policy to avoid disappointing fans and customers in the event of unforseen schedule changes. That said, it's still fun to guess!<br /> My predictions for 2019 Kickstarters:<br /> Feb 12, 2019: Lunars: announced on this past Monday Meetings post<br /> Early Apr 2019: Hunter the Vigil 2E (as the KS art has been in the works for a some weeks now and is further along than the Contgaion Chronicles art, which has just now been contracted. Plus, both it and Lunars are on the Development phase, so I don't see that as necessarily being a cause for slow down. 2/5/19: Monday Meetings says the HtV2's final KS art is coming in)<br /> Mid - May 2019: Contagion Chronicles (KS art has been contracted and it's actually further along in the development phases than either Lunars or HtV2e)<br /> Late June 2019: Trinity Aberrant<br /> August 2019: Not sure (Deviant the Renegades, Pirates of Pugmire, Mummy the Curse 2E, or Scion: Demigod are all further along (Deviant most; demigod and mummy least) than the Dragon or Mythos)<br /> Late Sept 2019: Scion: Dragon (today's announcement said KickstarterS - plural - aimed at late 2019, but not on the Monday Meeting's list of in progress yet)<br /> Early Nov 2019: Scion: Mythos of Chthulu (today's announcement said KickstarterS - plural - aimed at late 2019, but not on the Monday Meeting's list of in progress yet)<br /> <br /> Updated Predictions on the last days of the Lunars Kickstarter<br /> Late March 2019: Contagion Chronicles (confirmed here: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zFTknuOdHGk\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zFTknuOdHGk</a>)<br /> Early-May 2019: Trinity:Aberrant<br /> Mid-Late June: Hunter 2E<br /> Early August 2019: Pirates of Pugmire<br /> Mid-September 2019: Deviant the Renegade or M20 Technocracy Reloaded<br /> Late October/Early November 2019: Cult of the Blood Gods V5 or Deviant or M20<br /> Early December 2019: Mummy 2e or Cult of the Blood Gods V5<br /> <br /> Updated Prediction on the last days of the Contagion Chronicles<br /> Early May 2019: Pirates of Pugmire (confirmed here: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/whats-the-contagion-vector-victor-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/whats-the-con...meeting-notes/</a>)<br /> Mid-June 2019: Hunter 2E<br /> Early August 2019: Trinity: Aberrant<br /> Mid-September 2019: Deviant the Renegade or M20 Technocracy Reloaded<br /> Late October/Early November 2019: Cult of the Blood Gods V5 or Deviant or M20 TR<br /> Early December 2019: Mummy 2e or Cult of the Blood Gods V5","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12074,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","user":"Robert D","date":". 04-23-2019, 12:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T12:15:35-08:00","id":1283765,"title":"","content":"I'd put my bets on this order: <br /> <br /> Lunars<br /> Contagion<br /> Trinity<br /> Hunter<br /> Dragon<br /> Deviant<br /> Mythos<br /> <br /> I still feel like Contagion is going to Kickstart before Hunter because it is further along. I also expect that the Scion and Chronicles Kickstarters will be staggered so as not to drain people's wallets too much. I could be completely wrong though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T12:36:27-08:00","id":1283769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1283765#post1283765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still feel like Contagion is going to Kickstart before Hunter because it is further along. I also expect that the Scion and Chronicles Kickstarters will be staggered so as not to drain people's wallets too much. I could be completely wrong though.</div> </div> </div> </div>The reason why I paused at this notion was the fact that Hunter's KS art was even approved in the first place at an earlier stage compared to Contagion.<br /> <br /> Why would it be unless if it was at a stage that they were confident would be ready to go for KS sooner rather then later?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T12:42:53-08:00","id":1283772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1283769#post1283769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The reason why I paused at this notion was the fact that Hunter's KS art was even approved in the first place at an earlier stage compared to Contagion.<br /> <br /> Why would it be unless if it was at a stage that they were confident would be ready to go for KS sooner rather then later?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is true. In fact, its the only thing making me second guess if Contagion will be first. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T13:11:09-08:00","id":1283781,"title":"","content":"Another factor playing into this is the new Onyx Path Publishing KS account (you'll note that up till now the KSes have been through Rich's account). If the Scarred Lands 5e Creature Collection KS works out, I'd expect to see some of the projects in the list shifted over to the Onyx Path account, so we end up getting some overlap in KSes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":51,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","user":"marin","date":". 01-30-2019, 04:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T14:54:58-08:00","id":1283803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1283781#post1283781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another factor playing into this is the new Onyx Path Publishing KS account (you'll note that up till now the KSes have been through Rich's account). If the Scarred Lands 5e Creature Collection KS works out, I'd expect to see some of the projects in the list shifted over to the Onyx Path account, so we end up getting some overlap in KSes.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I missed the announcement about the new KS account. Is it up and running already?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T20:49:24-08:00","id":1283844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1283765#post1283765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd put my bets on this order:<br /> <br /> Lunars<br /> Contagion<br /> Trinity<br /> Hunter<br /> Dragon<br /> Deviant<br /> Mythos<br /> <br /> I still feel like Contagion is going to Kickstart before Hunter because it is further along. I also expect that the Scion and Chronicles Kickstarters will be staggered so as not to drain people's wallets too much. I could be completely wrong though.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> My only concern about this is a possible situation like Dark Eras had (and Beast's Kinship Nightmares to a lesser extent), where the book came out so far in advance of some of the cores that the mechanics were hard if not impossible to adapt (see the Courts from Dark Eras which make mention of the Goblin Vow and Approaches in their Mantles - you could adapt Goblin Vow since the 1e merit was fairly and intentionally light on mechanics, but the Approaches thing is far harder and may have to be replaced outright) or reference concepts that may not exist in the new game (see the Geist kinship merits in Beast for the biggest problem there). Of course, there's going to be SOME possibility of that - Deviant also won't be out, and Mummy 2E is appearing to be more likely for 2020 and may have some differences - but it is still a bit of a concern to have it come out before Hunter does.<br /> <br /> My negativity aside (it's been a long day for me. Long month, actually, And since this month is also technically the entire year....):<br /> <br /> I really am fine with getting Contagion Chronicle like yes please.<br /> <br /> I am running a crossover CoD LARP with mortals, Vampires, Changelings, Werewolves, Mages, and Beasts (and some elements of Demon thrown in for good measure, though not playable Unchained), and while that is nowhere near as difficult as, say, running a crossover WoD LARP in the MET system days where you had rules that didn't even line up, it still would be helpful to see some more cross-splat interaction rules and ideas spelled out, if not for the current chronicle I am running then possibly for ones in the future. Also, the ideas we've seen so far are SWEET.<br /> <br /> And though I want my sweet sweet 2E Vigil rules (especially after I saw the idea for Infernal Visions in the playtest...), I don't quite need that fix as badly since they got a partial translation in the form of Mortal Remains and Tooth and Nail, and work well enough (though I do hope the Statuses have benefits at every level like MCI and the 2E Mantles did... dead levels are an irritant to me in any system).<br /> <br /> Honestly, I'm most excited for Deviant of them all. So the longer I have to wait for THAT, the harder it will hurt. But still... more content is generally better than less, and I'm excited for this year (at least as far as gaming goes).<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Side question actually - any predictions on Mummy 2E? It's still in First Draft for now, so it probably will be a while yet, but just wondering if anyone has any guesses on if it'll hit early or late next year.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T21:09:13-08:00","id":1283849,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EndlessKng</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1283844#post1283844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My only concern about this is a possible situation like Dark Eras had (and Beast's Kinship Nightmares to a lesser extent), where the book came out so far in advance of some of the cores that the mechanics were hard if not impossible to adapt (see the Courts from Dark Eras which make mention of the Goblin Vow and Approaches in their Mantles - you could adapt Goblin Vow since the 1e merit was fairly and intentionally light on mechanics, but the Approaches thing is far harder and may have to be replaced outright) or reference concepts that may not exist in the new game (see the Geist kinship merits in Beast for the biggest problem there). Of course, there's going to be SOME possibility of that - Deviant also won't be out, and Mummy 2E is appearing to be more likely for 2020 and may have some differences - but it is still a bit of a concern to have it come out before Hunter does.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's already been addressed.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar152_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"152\" data-vbnamecard=\"152\">The Gentleman Gamer</a> has confirmed that the Contagion Chronicle will be using all of the 2e versions and rulesets for all the splats. Presumably there's no danger of the MtC2e rules being suddenly thrown out and rewritten as they are right now...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T23:44:14-08:00","id":1283861,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1283803#post1283803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I missed the announcement about the new KS account. Is it up and running already?</div> </div> </div> </div>Rich brings up the new KS account in <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/i-get-a-kick-from-this-starter-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">this week's Monday Meeting</a>. It's going to kick off with the SL 5e Creature Collection KS.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rich Thomas</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Finally, we\u2019re trying a new thing this coming year, as even with James, we\u2019re hard-pressed to run all the Kickstarter campaigns we\u2019d like to \u2013 that we think would be good for the projects we\u2019re making. Our friends and <b>Handiwork Games </b>will be creating the <b>Scarred Lands 5e Creature Collection</b> and then running its Kickstarter on a new <b>Onyx Path Publishing</b> Kickstarter account. If this works out, we\u2019ll have more flexibility on which KSs happen when, and we\u2019ll look at how things go and maybe we\u2019ll have more of our projects KS\u2019d by other folks.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-31T01:27:52-08:00","id":1283868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1283849#post1283849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's already been addressed.<br /> <br /> <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> has confirmed that the Contagion Chronicle will be using all of the 2e versions and rulesets for all the splats. Presumably there's no danger of the MtC2e rules being suddenly thrown out and rewritten as they are right now...</div> </div> </div> </div>+1<br /> <br /> We're making sure the rules in Contagion (and Dark Eras 2) cater to 2e for all game lines.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-31T20:15:55-08:00","id":1284061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1283849#post1283849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's already been addressed.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar152_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"152\" data-vbnamecard=\"152\">The Gentleman Gamer</a> has confirmed that the Contagion Chronicle will be using all of the 2e versions and rulesets for all the splats. Presumably there's no danger of the MtC2e rules being suddenly thrown out and rewritten as they are right now...</div> </div> </div> </div>WELP.<br /> <br /> Bring it on then. I no longer have any fears or concerns.<br /> <br /> I am, I believe the phrase is, down with the sickness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-05T06:08:30-08:00","id":1284935,"title":"","content":"Hunter 2E is at the &quot;Finals for KS coming in&quot; in the Art Direction section!! It will be next on the 2019 list of Kickstarters I believe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-