:{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-12T20:38:24-07:00","id":1296326,"title":"","content":"Hunter 2E and Deviant are all that matter to me. I wanna see how Hunter interacts with both Changeling and Deviant. The Hunt Begins Ever Anew. Also, I would like to note that Deviant kinda strikes me as Man-made Changelings. I believe I am going to enjoy the parallels between the two.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7106-extant-reality","name":"Extant Reality","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7106_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-13T06:25:43-07:00","id":1296384,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Here's a rundown of the &quot;still-to-be Kickstarted&quot; projects from Monday's Meeting Blog: (I've included Cults of the Blood Gods since the last V5 project Chicago by Night for V5 got a kickstarter) It is of interest that Lunars 3 is listed as in Development but still got to Kickstarter before Contagion, so the exact placement on the development process isn't an exact estimator of relative placement in this year's KS schedule. Based on this though, I would suggest that depending on when the Trinity Core and Aeon get to the printing stage, the next KS after Contation will be either Trinity: Aberrant (if the Core and Aeon make it to Print by the time Contagion's KS begins) or Hunter 2e (if Trinity Core and Aeon are not yet at print AND Hunter 2e gets through Manuscript Approval by the time Contagion' KS is halfway done). Pirates of Pugmire would be my guess for the third KS after Trinity: Aberrant and Hunter 2. After that it is all up for grabs based on speed of writing, editing, dev and art collection between Deviant, Mummy 2, and possibly Cults of the Blood Gods IF that one gets a KS. With the three Scion books and Legendlore still being in First Draft, I would not expect any of them to get kickstarters until LATE in 2019 or perhaps early in 2020.<br /> <b>First Draft</b> (The first phase of a project that is about the work being done by writers, not dev prep)</span></span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Legendlore core book (Legendlore)</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Scion: Demigod (Scion 2nd Edition)</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Masks of the Mythos (Scion 2nd Edition)</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Scion: Dragon (Scion 2nd Edition)</span></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Redlines</b></span></span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Mummy: The Curse 2nd Edition core rulebook (Mummy: The Curse 2nd Edition)</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Cults of the Blood Gods (Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition)</span></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Second Draft</b></span></span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Deviant: The Renegades (Deviant: The Renegades)</span></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Development</b></span></span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Hunter: the Vigil 2e core (Hunter: the Vigil 2nd Edition)</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Lunars: Fangs at the Gate (Exalted 3rd Edition)</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Pirates of Pugmire (Realms of Pugmire)</b></span></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Manuscript Approval:</b></span></span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Trinity Continuum: Aberrant core (Trinity Continuum: Aberrant)</span></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Editing:</b></span></span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11px\">CofD Contagion Chronicle (Chronicles of Darkness)</span></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Post-Editing Development:<br /> Indexing:</b></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>In Art Direction</b></span></span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Hunter: The Vigil 2e</b></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Contagion Chronicle</b> <b>\u2013 </b>AD\u2019d for KS</span></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>In Layout:</b></span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Proofing:</b></span></span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Trinity Core \u2013 </b>Putting inMind Meld changes.</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Trinity Aeon \u2013 </b>Putting in Mind Meld changes.</span></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>At Press</b></span></span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Scion Hero \u2013 </b>Printing. PoD proof getting worked on.</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Scion Origin \u2013 </b>Printing. PoD proof ordered</span></li> </ul><br /> My new KS predictions: <br /> Late March/Early April 2019: Contagion Chronicle<br /> Mid-May 2019: Trinity:Aberrant<br /> Late June/Early July 2019: Hunter 2E<br /> Early August 2019: Pirates of Pugmire<br /> Mid-September 2019: Deviant the Renegade<br /> Late October/Early November 2019: Cult of the Blood Gods V5<br /> Early December 2019: Mummy 2e<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-13T10:51:12-07:00","id":1296448,"title":"","content":"Also, I should note that on the World of Darkness 20 note, Mage20's Technocracy Reloaded and Victorian Mage are also being considered for KS. With TR being at Second Drafts stage like Deviant.<br /> <br /> And that's without even considering the possibility of Hunter: the Reckoning 20th (which admittedly is less certain as of this post).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-nam