=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T11:46:23-07:00","id":1307264,"title":"","content":"You thought it was Hunter, but it was me, Dio!<br /> <br /> (I don't know.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T13:28:48-07:00","id":1307288,"title":"","content":"Updated Prediction on the last days of the Contagion Chronicles<br /> Early May 2019: Pirates of Pugmire (confirmed here: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/whats-the-contagion-vector-victor-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/whats-the-con...meeting-notes/</a>)<br /> Mid-June 2019: Hunter 2E<br /> Early August 2019: Trinity: Aberrant<br /> Mid-September 2019: Deviant the Renegade or M20 Technocracy Reloaded<br /> Late October/Early November 2019: Cult of the Blood Gods V5 or Deviant or M20 TR<br /> Early December 2019: Mummy 2e or Cult of the Blood Gods V5<br /> <br /> Premise/Argument 1: I'm betting Hunter 2e will be next as it's been in Art Direction for some time, and Trinity Core and Aeon are not yet out of indexing, so even though the text of Aberrant has gotten to Manuscript Approval, and Hunter hasn't, Hunter is already a bit along in the Art department and doesn't have to wait for earlier books to finish the publication process the way Aberrant does. <br /> <br /> Premise/Argument 2: Technocracy and Deviant are both in Development (Deviant more recently though), making them the next furthest along of the KS considered books. Making both contenders for the Mid and Late Fall Kickstarters<br /> <br /> Premise/Argument 3: Cult of the Blood Gods for V5 has recently moved into second Drafts (and has been moving quite rapidly in its writing process). It's comparative speed in the process of publication gives me hope that it will be either the mid-Fall or December 2019 Kickstarter.<br /> <br /> Premise/Argument 4: Mummy the Curse 2E is still in Redlines, making it likely to either be the last of this year's Kickstarters or the first of the 2020 Kickstarters.<br /> <br /> Premise/Argument 5: Scion: Dragons, Scion: Cthulu, Scion: Demigod, &amp; M20 Victorian Mage are all in First Drafts still, making 2019 kickstarters unlikely, put possibly showing us the 2020 KS schedule, possibly with Mummy the Curse 2E, and who knows, there are still several varieties of Exalted that have yet to get Kickstarters.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T15:20:54-07:00","id":1307315,"title":"","content":"Well Hunter had to get some stuff rewritten because of certain things. so they might do pirates and something else before they do Hunter. I do hope the kickstarter drops soon though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T15:37:41-07:00","id":1307318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grimmi05</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1307315#post1307315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well Hunter had to get some stuff rewritten because of certain things.</div> </div> </div> </div>?<br /> <br /> First time I'm hearing this. Source?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T20:12:09-07:00","id":1307394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"