:"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T06:25:18-07:00","id":1307454,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure OPP is worried about (or should be worried about) getting the Aeon Continuum base book out before they do an Aberrant kickstarter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T09:47:45-07:00","id":1307504,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1307454#post1307454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure OPP is worried about (or should be worried about) getting the Aeon Continuum base book out before they do an Aberrant kickstarter.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would <i>really</i> stall out the process.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T10:51:05-07:00","id":1307533,"title":"","content":"Would it? They still have a draft version they can link to. Link that and whatever preview they have going of the Aberrant book at the same time. After all, not everyone funding the campaign will have already bought the Trinity Continuum corebook beforehand. Some people are going to show up because it's Aberrant, and I'll be super surprised if OPP doesn't have pledge levels for the TCC and Aberrant as well as for just the Aberrant book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T11:28:36-07:00","id":1307542,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1307533#post1307533\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would it? They still have a draft version they can link to. Link that and whatever preview they have going of the Aberrant book at the same time. After all, not everyone funding the campaign will have already bought the Trinity Continuum corebook beforehand. Some people are going to show up because it's Aberrant, and I'll be super surprised if OPP doesn't have pledge levels for the TCC and Aberrant as well as for just the Aberrant book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, it would. Production lines need to keep moving, you can't just sit and wait to put a bow on things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-24T12:01:53-07:00","id":1307550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1283761-2019-kickstarter-schedule-speculation?p=1307542#post1307542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, it would. Production lines need to keep moving, you can't just sit and wait to put a bow on things.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think either you misunderstood what I meant or I'm misunderstanding what you meant. I meant they shouldn't delay the Aberrant kickstarter until the final version of Trinity came out. They don't need a finished version of Trinity for the kickstarter and running the Aberrant kickstarter is not going to slow down Trinity coming out. They're two separate workflows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-03T07:16:39-07:00","id":1309638,"title":"","content":"This week's Monday Meeting blog showed Aberrant is starting KS art contracting. Moves it up in terms of likelihood to come after Pirates of Pugmire and likely before Hunter 2e now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-05T12:05:12-07:00","id":1310083,"title":"","content":"Well I'm not into Pugmire or Aberrent, so I'll pass on those. I could use a break from Kickstarter so that is a good thing. I backed Critical Role, Subverse by FOW Studios, Contagion Chronicles, Arcana of the Ancients, and Odyssey of the Dragon Lords in April, so it'd be nice to take a break from kickstarter for a few months.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},